el (prints plain `(ask)` because `typed: true`)","+   Case: the prompt \"my deep review run is stuck, /deep:review again\" gets the native head `system-deep-loop → /deep:review (ask)`, where the doctor command is expected; the Python fallback gives no run row for the same prompt.","+","+```json","+{\"type\":\"claim-adjudication\",\"findingId\":\"R1-P1-001\",\"claim\":\"For a stuck-run prompt that also types /deep:review, the native recommend output carries /deep:review instead of /doctor:deep-loop, which diverges from the Python fallback and the stuck-run rule.\",\"evidenceRefs\":[\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/handlers/advisor-recommend.ts:428\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/handlers/advisor-recommend.ts:628\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts:257\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts:837\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/skill_advisor.py:4848\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/deep-loop-offer-cases.vitest.ts:65\"],\"counterevidenceSought\":\"Looked for a stuck check inside typedCommandForTop or attachTypedCommand, and for a test that runs the typed-stuck case through attachTypedCommand. Found neither. The guards suite covers stuck only through attachCommand (command-attach-guards.vitest.ts:575-593).\",\"alternativeExplanation\":\"The authors may intend a typed command to always win, as the comment at advisor-recommend.ts:424 says. But the fixture's typedReviewKept=false and the Python docstring both say a stuck run drops the typed run, so that intent contradicts the packet's own pinned answer.\",\"finalSeverity\":\"P1\",\"confidence\":0.85,\"downgradeTrigger\":\"Downgrade to P2 if the operator rules that a typed command outranks the stuck diagnosis and the fixture plus the Python gate are changed to match.\"}","+```","+","+### P2 Findings","+None.","+","+## Traceability Checks","+- spec_code (partial): the spec's explicit-loop clauses (spec.md §2) match `LOOP_WORDING`, `ITERATIVE_ASK`, `MULTI_PASS`, `LOOP_COUNT` and `LOOP_NAMES`. Typed `/deep:*` is honoured through `typedCommandIn`. Depth-only prompts return undefined (probe: \"do a thorough review of the parser\" → undefined on all three paths). The continue/resume/extend clause runs through `LOOP_CONTINUE_VERB` (command-attach.ts:556).","+- checklist_evidence: deferred to the traceability iteration.","+","+## Integration Evidence","+- `advisor-recommend.ts` handler → `attachCommand` → `attachTypedCommand` → `render.ts commandLabel`, all read directly.","+- `skill-advisor-cli-fallback.ts:393-395` carries `typed` from the CLI output into the hook brief.","+","+## Edge Cases","+- Dist is not built in this worktree, so the TS source was probed through a type-stripping loader. The handler module uses TS-only syntax and could not be loaded, so the override at `attachTypedCommand` is proved by direct read plus `typedCommandForTop` output, not by an end-to-end run.","+- A deferred route ignores typed commands inside `deferredLoopCommand` (command-attach.ts:899-919). `attachTypedCommand` restores them later, so that is not a defect on its own.","+","+## Confirmed-Clean Surfaces","+- Refused typed command: \"do not run /deep:review, just tell me what it does\" → no command on every path.","+- Depth-only prompt: no command on any path.","+- Typed command with a mode suffix (`/deep:review:auto`) resolves to `/deep:review`.","+","+## Ruled Out","+- Routed research mode attaching `/deep:research` to \"run 5 review iterations\": this depends on the router picking research for a review-named prompt, which I did not observe. Not reported.","+","+## Next Focus","+- Dimension: security","+- Focus area: untrusted prompt text through the regex gate (ReDoS-prone nested quantifiers in LOOP_REQUEST, COMMAND_* leads), plus the `typed` flag trust through the CLI fallback","+- Reason: rotation; the gate runs on every prompt","+- Rotation status: correctness done (1/4)","+- Required evidence: timing probe on adversarial long prompts","+","+Review verdict: CONDITIONAL"]}],"created":true}],"moreFiles":0,"changedFiles":["/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/533-deep-loop-offers-deep-review/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/012-deep-loop-command-offers/review/lineages/opus-medium-1/iterations/iteration-001.md"]}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01L2mwh1kayRS4umVMW9Z7gT","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
