{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_018zRUFFcuK4bVj3zzw4pdWu","type":"tool_result","content":"[several passes of the linter failed, review the config] => Advisor: live; use system-deep-loop 0.84/0.16 pass.\n[review our multi-pass compiler] => Advisor: live; ambiguous: system-deep-loop 0.90/0.16 vs sk-code 0.90/0.12 pass.\n[run a deep review on the parser] => Advisor: live; ambiguous: system-deep-loop → /deep:review (ask: A /deep:review:auto (Recommended), B /deep:review:confirm, C no loop) 0.95/0.16 vs sk-code 0.90/0.12 pass.\n[do 5 research iterations on caching] => Advisor: live; use system-deep-loop → /deep:research (ask: A /deep:research:auto (Recommended), B /deep:research:confirm, C no loop) 0.82/0.24 pass.\n[review the parser in several passes] => Advisor: live; use system-deep-loop → /deep:review (ask: A /deep:review:auto (Recommended), B /deep:review:confirm, C no loop) 0.88/0.12 pass.\n[don't run /deep:review, explain the review loop] => Advisor: live; use system-deep-loop 0.95/0.12 pass.\n[what does /deep:review do?] => Advisor: live; ambiguous: system-deep-loop 0.94/0.16 vs sk-code 0.90/0.12 pass.\n[see (/deep:review.md) for the flags] => Advisor: live; ambiguous: system-deep-loop 0.91/0.16 vs sk-code 0.87/0.12 pass.\n[my deep review run is stuck, /deep:review again] => Advisor: live; use system-deep-loop → /deep:review (ask) 0.95/0.12 pass.\n[/deep:review:confirm the auth module] => Advisor: live; use system-deep-loop → /deep:review (ask) 0.94/0.12 pass.\n[/deep:review:confirm the auth module] => Advisor: live; use system-deep-loop → /deep:review (ask) 0.94/0.12 pass.\n[/deep:research:auto vector index compaction] => Advisor: live; use system-deep-loop → /deep:research (ask) 0.84/0.12 pass.\n[run /deep:review on the parser] => Advisor: live; ambiguous: system-deep-loop → /deep:review (ask) 0.94/0.16 vs sk-code 0.90/0.12 pass.\nspecs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/012-deep-loop-command-offers/implementation-