ate log before closeout, and each lineage already adjudicated its own findings, so the merged counts are the authority here.\"\n134:          # The row is staged for the append gateway: the state log is a projection of the\n136:          command: |\n137:            GATEWAY=\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/append-mode-event.cjs\"\n138:            [ -f \"$GATEWAY\" ] || GATEWAY=\"scripts/append-mode-event.cjs\"\n144:            {\"stem\":\"deep_review.claim_adjudication\",\"scope\":{\"runId\":\"{session_id}\",\"sessionId\":\"{session_id}\"},\"data\":{\"mode\":\"{adjudication_mode}\",\"run\":{adjudication_run},\"passed\":{adjudication_passed},\"activeP0P1\":{adjudication_active_p0_p1},\"missingPackets\":{adjudication_missing_packets},\"\n153:            node .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/reduce-state.cjs {spec_folder} {reducer_artifact_arg} --create-missing-anchors\n155:            action: \"Halt with STATUS=FAIL through step_release_lock. An append the gateway rejected leaves the ledger and the registry disagreeing, so the verdict that follows would read a stale count.\"\n157:            release_lock: step_release_lock\n165:      step_derive_verdict:\n170:          command: |\n171:            node .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/review-verdict.cjs \\\n179:          bind_from_output:\n186:          on_fail: \"Halt with STATUS=FAIL through step_release_lock. The values the merge bound are the authority on a fan-out root, so an unreadable bound value must stop the run rather than let a verdict be guessed.\"\n188:          command: |\n189:            node .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/review-verdict.cjs \\\n194:          bind_from_output:\n201:          on_fail: \"Halt with STATUS=FAIL through step_release_lock. A non-zero exit means the registry or the state log could not be read, so this stop has no verdict yet and none may be assumed.\"\n213:      step_emit_resource_map:\n214:        skip_when: \"config.fanout is present\"\n217:        command: \"node .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/reduce-state.cjs {spec_folder} {reducer_artifact_arg} --create-missing-anchors --emit-resource-map\"\n226:      step_resource_map_coverage_gate:\n230:      step_compile_review_report:\n235:             - Executive Summary: open with `Review did not run`, state the stop reason and `0 iterations dispatched`, keep the verdict and hasAdvisories bound by step_derive_verdict unchanged, and state that the P0/P1/P2 counts mean not examined rather than clean.\n289:             - Always include this section before the appendix.\n296:             - Cross-reference appendix MUST be split into `Core Protocols` and `Overlay Protocols`\n299:        output: \"{state_paths.review_output}\"\n301:      step_derive_release_readiness_state:\n314:      step_convergence_report:\n317:        command: |\n318:          GATEWAY=\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/append-mode-event.cjs\"\n319:          [ -f \"$GATEWAY\" ] || GATEWAY=\"scripts/append-mode-event.cjs\"\n321:          CLOSEOUT=\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/synthesis-closeout.cjs\"\n348:      step_update_config_status:\n354:      step_refresh_completed_dashboard:\n356:        skip_when: \"config.fanout is present\"\n358:        command: \"node .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/reduce-state.cjs {spec_folder} {reducer_artifact_arg} --create-missing-anchors\"\n360:        note: \"Every earlier reducer pass ran before closeout wrote synthesis_complete and before the status flip, so the dashboard would keep its pre-completion status. A fan-out root keeps no root dashboard.\"\n363:      step_stage_artifact_dir:\n364:        skip_when: \"config.fanout_lineage_artifact_dir is present\"\n367:        command: 'git add -- \"{state_paths.packet_dir}\"'","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false,"bashEditDiff":{"files":[],"moreFiles":0,"unavailable":true}},"too